    LLM: 'SINGLE DRAW VERSION:\n1. Dealer deals 5 cards to each player\n2. First betting round (beginning left of blinds)\n3. Players may discard 0-5 cards and receive replacements\n4. Second betting round\n5. Showdown - lowest hand wins\n\nTRIPLE DRAW VERSION:\n1. Deal 5 cards to each player\n2. First betting round\n3. First draw (discard and replace)\n4. Second betting round\n5. Second draw\n6. Third betting round\n7. Third draw\n8. Final betting round\n9. Showdown\n\nNote: If dealer runs out of cards during multiple draws, discards are shuffled to form new deck',
